        "content": "[Tail workers](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/observability/logs/tail-workers/) seem like a solid solution to this sort of thing. \r\nOne worker to catch all exceptions in other workers; it could then ping via TG the exception that happened, where, when, who and how straight into a private chat filled with proactive trusted contributors.\r\nRequires a paid plan, something we have avoided but eventually we are going to have to bite that bullet I think.",
